WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.553 --> 00:00:02.254
The road is rotten.

00:00:04.455 --> 00:00:08.518
We arrive at Turkmenistan's most famous
landmark, a hole.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:16.303
Darwaza, nicknamed the gateway to hell, is
a symbol of the country's immense gas

00:00:16.303 --> 00:00:16.343
wealth.

00:00:16.363 --> 00:00:21.827
It's been 50 years since methane emissions
have occurred due to an accident in the

00:00:21.827 --> 00:00:23.827
digging of a mine.

00:00:23.827 --> 00:00:27.011
And it's been 50 years since this crater
has been on fire.

00:00:30.568 --> 00:00:33.150
It's 70 meters long, 30 meters deep.

00:00:33.591 --> 00:00:38.374
In 1971, Soviet scientists set fire to the
crater to stop a gas leak.

00:00:39.095 --> 00:00:40.636
They thought the fire would not last.

00:00:41.197 --> 00:00:43.298
Today, it's still as powerful as ever.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.942
Of course, this gas is constantly burning.

00:01:00.943 --> 00:01:02.783
There are many toxic emissions.

00:01:02.784 --> 00:01:06.305
We can feel it in our breath, we have a
sore throat.

00:01:06.425 --> 00:01:09.167
But what comes out of the ground is
methane.

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:13.470
And Turkmenistan is one of the world's
main polluters because of methane.

00:01:13.471 --> 00:01:15.731
It's a real ecological disaster.

00:01:16.672 --> 00:01:21.615
Because of leaks, every year the country
emits 4.4 million tonnes of methane.

00:01:22.616 --> 00:01:26.098
A greenhouse gas 80 times more harmful
than CO2.

00:01:26.759 --> 00:01:28.620
But the authorities don't seem to mind.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:33.363
The site has been transformed into an
attraction where meat is barbecued in the

00:01:33.363 --> 00:01:33.564
evening.

00:01:40.348 --> 00:01:44.371
And where a small camp with yurts has been
set up to welcome tourists.

00:01:46.716 --> 00:01:50.038
Good evening from the middle of the
Karakum desert.

00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:54.061
Do you know how many tourists visit this
place each year?

00:01:55.342 --> 00:01:56.042
Each year?

00:01:56.183 --> 00:01:58.404
Totally it's 12 000.

00:01:58.405 --> 00:01:59.105
Yeah.

00:01:59.105 --> 00:02:05.489
But this is a famous place so I think that
more than half of them visit this place.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.772
But now I'm busy, I have to prepare
another two.

00:02:09.924 --> 00:02:10.624
That's for you.

00:02:11.765 --> 00:02:17.387
With just 12,000 tourists a year,
Turkmenistan is one of the least visited

00:02:17.387 --> 00:02:19.387
countries in the world.

00:02:19.387 --> 00:02:22.188
Here we are.

00:02:22.189 --> 00:02:27.290
A small mattress and a small military
sleeping bag.

00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:27.991
And off we go.

00:02:29.391 --> 00:02:32.132
A peaceful night awaits us in the toxic
fumes.

